  "summary": "This message is a work-from-home job offer for a 'package inspector' position, and multiple sources — including the Federal Trade Commission — identify this exact type of offer as a scam that has been sent to people across multiple states. In these 'reshipping' scams, criminals pose as legitimate companies and claim the job simply involves receiving packages, inspecting them, re-boxing them, and sending them to another address. Until you can confirm things through an official channel, it's safest not to pay anything or share any codes or personal details.",
